## Phase 4: API Endpoints + Flag Integration

### New Auth Dependencies (add to [supabase_auth.py](file:///home/sudais/projects/FYPILOT-BACKEND/app/auth/supabase_auth.py))
```python
def require_faculty_with_flag(flag: str):
    """Factory: checks role=faculty AND a specific flag on their profile."""
    async def checker(user=Depends(get_current_user)):
        role_val = user.role.value if hasattr(user.role, "value") else user.role
        if role_val != "faculty":
            raise HTTPException(403, "Faculty access required")
        profile = user.faculty_profile
        if not profile or not getattr(profile, flag, False):
            raise HTTPException(403, f"{flag} privilege required")
        return user
    return checker
```

